"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the earlier-arriving Aeroplan award if getting to Bangkok sooner matters most. The tradeoff is leaving San Francisco 11h30 earlier and spending 5 minutes longer in transit; the other shown award leaves later and has the slightly shorter elapsed time.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J8@2027-01-15T11:45-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-16T22:25\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan award — earlier arrival\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO Jan 15 at 11:45 and arrives in Bangkok Jan 16 at 22:25 local time. The award is reported as economy, with 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 107.40 in taxes and fees; the quote scope is unknown, so that amount is not established as a per-person or total price. Nine seats are reported. The route connects at HKG with a 70-minute wait. The source does not specify the cabin of each leg.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T02\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"This arrives 11h25 earlier than the later-departing award below. Its downside is a much earlier SFO departure; the elapsed journey is also 5 minutes longer.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J14@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T09:50\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan award — later departure\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO Jan 15 at 23:15 and arrives in Bangkok Jan 17 at 09:50 local time. It is also reported as an economy award for 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 107.40 in taxes and fees, with unknown quote scope, and nine seats reported. It connects at HKG with a 70-minute wait; the cabin of each leg is unspecified. Its advantage is the later SFO departure, but it reaches Bangkok later.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T03\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash reference — Singapore Airlines\",\"v\":\"The shown cash itinerary departs SFO Jan 15 at 09:40 and arrives in Bangkok Jan 17 at 08:25 local time, with one stop via SIN and a reported duration of 31h45. The quote is USD 440, with unknown scope. It is a cash baseline, not a like-for-like total-cost comparison with an award requiring points and taxes.\"},